This attribution inventory is supplied by sqlmem, not an upstream NOTICE file.

Modified by sqlmem: the compositor's fixed dimension-expression compiler uses
an exhaustive arithmetic switch instead of dynamic JavaScript compilation.
The exact upstream hash, patched hash and reproducible build script are recorded
in manifest.json. No other upstream behavior is intentionally changed.
